    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζοφ-ερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζόφος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dusky, gloomy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					814
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Acut.(Sp.</i>) <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>, cf. Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.33A.
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπρός</span>, of the air,
				<i>misty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.140
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θάλασσαν ζοφερὰν διαφαίνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					843a25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ζοφερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Virg.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				426b2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. φροντίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.296.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>).</div>
